    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory used vs container limit",
      "description": "Working set as a share of the memory limit (cAdvisor and kube-state-metrics). Keep the memory_limiter below the limit so the collector refuses data before it is OOM-killed.",
